   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">ResearchProject — Project Information Template</text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">Climate Knowledge Graph (ClimateKG)</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Instruction_20_Box">Instructions for non-technical editors: This document is the source of truth for all project information outputs (XML, HTML webpage, GitLab README, Wikidata entries, etc.). Fill in or update the English (EN) and German (DE) columns below. URLs, identifiers, and names that do not require translation — write &quot;(= EN)&quot; in the DE column. When done, pass the updated file to the technical team who will update the XML files and regenerate all outputs. Schema reference: https://schema.org/ResearchProject | DTD: ResearchProject.dtd</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">Active Project Fields</text:h>
   <table:table table:name="ActiveFields" table:style-name="ActiveFields">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="ActiveFields.A"/>
